#Find Number of Negative Numbers in an array

Input : [1,5,7,0,-3,-85,-7]
ouptut : 3

Logic : 1) Go to each element, ask are u a number lessthan zero or not 
          if less than zero --> count the number in counter varible
          if greater thatn or equeal to zero --> ignore those numbers

code:


#No.of Negative numers in an array

def Find_NegativeNumbers(Numbers):
    count = 0
    size = len(Numbers)

    for i in range(0,size):
        if(Numbers[i]<0):
            count = count +1 
    return count


data = [10,25,67,-1,-8,-36,-8,]
output = Find_NegativeNumbers(data)
print(output)
